    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he clæne beo æt þam ordale, nime úpp his mǽge; gif he þonne ful beo, licge þar he lǽg, ⁊ gilde an C.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he prove innocent at the ordeal, he shall remove his kinsman [from his grave in unconsecrated ground]. If, however, he be guilty, the thief shall lie where he is, and he himself shall pay 100 [of silver].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si mundus sit in ordalio, diffodiat cognatum suum; si uero sit immundus, iaceat ipse fur ubi iacebat, et alius reddat.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
